OL,3,GNEWSAUnited Ireland would be a 'great
OL,4,Athing', says Trump during first day of
OL,5,AIrish visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FNo 10 has responded to the remarks,
OL,8,Fwhile the Democratic Unionist Party
OL,9,Fsays Northern Ireland's constitutional
OL,10,Ffuture "won't be decided by commentary
OL,11,Fin London, Dublin or Washington"
OL,13,FTrump held separate meetings earlier
OL,14,Fwith Taoiseach (Irish Prime Minister)
OL,15,FMicheal Martin and Irish President
OL,16,FCatherine Connolly
OL,18,FTraffic is at a standstill in parts of
OL,19,FDublin city centre as a protest with
OL,20,Fmore than 10,000 people made its way
OL,21,Fthrough the Irish capital
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
